**NR-AA’s principal repair works:** the complete-factorisation induction now closes under HAD, LV6′ and Theorem U. I found no remaining FATAL issue. One MAJOR error remains in HR(b)’s auxiliary density statement; it does not invalidate NR-AA.

I reread all 687 lines, including §9. All eight tests pass; all ten E1 rows and the complete E2 summary reproduce exactly. Writes were confined to the permitted scratch directory.

